    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m"{% if termsWithAnchors %} id="keeping-records-accurate" tabindex="-1"{% endif %}>Keep records accurate and use HMPPS Digital Services professionally</h2>
    <p class="govuk-body">What you record is used across HMPPS to make operational decisions. Inaccurate entries can lead to poor decisions.</p>
    <p class="govuk-body">You must:</p>
    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
      <li>record information accurately</li>
      <li>update records promptly</li>
      <li>correct mistakes where appropriate</li>
      <li>only use HMPPS Digital Services for official HMPPS business</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="govuk-body">All data you enter into HMPPS Digital Services is potentially liable to legal disclosure under the <a class='govuk-link govuk-link--no-visited-state' href="https://www.legislation.gov.uk/ukpga/2018/12/contents" target=_blank>Data Protection Act</a> and/or the <a class='govuk-link govuk-link--no-visited-state' href="https://www.legislation.gov.uk/ukpga/2000/36/contents" target=_blank>Freedom of Information Act</a>.</p>

